# Next-page workflow

## Before coding a new screen
0. **All work happens in the general admin module** (`src/pages/ga/*`, `src/components/ga/*`, `mockGa.js`). The supervisor module is frozen — see the FROZEN section in the baseline rule. Copy a shared component into `src/components/ga/` rather than editing it.
1. Reuse the module `Layout` (`GaLayout` / `ItLayout` / …) via `AppShell` (title or in-page breadcrumb like RequestDetail).
2. Wrap content in **`.page-shell`** — see `mped-responsive-shell` rule. Mirror spacing/typography from the closest accepted page.
3. Put **presentation** data in the module's mock file; keep Arabic field labels. Business data both modules act on (requests, notes, users, stages) belongs in `src/domain/` — see the baseline rule's integration section.
4. Wire route in `src/App.jsx` and nav only if product asks.

