## Pattern checklist for every new page
- [ ] RTL + Cairo; `text-right` for Arabic blocks
- [ ] Root content uses **`.page-shell`** (not raw `p-8` / page-level `max-w-[1535.5px]`)
- [ ] White cards `rounded-2xl` / radius 20 where peers use it; border `#D8D8D8` when bordered
- [ ] Primary actions: `bg-navy` or `bg-primary` consistent with siblings
- [ ] Status via `StatusBadge` + `statusBadge` map
- [ ] Lists: reuse `RequestList` / FilterModal patterns when applicable
- [ ] Modals: **`.modal-overlay`** + peer chrome (`ConfirmModal` / `SuccessModal` / IT `ItModal`); card `w-full max-w-[…]`
- [ ] Charts (if any): same ChartCard selector + 5-type switching
- [ ] Do not reintroduce frame `min-width: 1100`, shrink sidebar breakpoints, chart card height, or selector frame without explicit ask

## Dual request modes
- `mode="forms"` vs `mode="required"` — required adds **استيفاء البيانات** tab; messages differ on approve.
- Always keep statement-specific `formTable` / `fulfillmentTable` schemas.
